# Alan VPS relay — Caddy front door (example, edit before use)
#
# 1. Replace sites.example.com with YOUR domain (DNS A-record -> VPS public IP).
# 2. Replace 8080 with the remotePort you configured in the Alan Relay screen.
# 3. Copy to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile and run: sudo systemctl reload caddy
#
# Caddy terminates real HTTPS automatically (like Coolify's reverse proxy
# + auto-certificates) and forwards plain HTTP to sshd's forwarded port,
# which ssh -R tunnels back to the phone's Alan reverse proxy.

sites.example.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
